TypeScript tests for retained-observable authoring and projection behavior.\n\n## Done criteria\n\n- Users can create retained observables independent of losses.\n- Authored observables are persisted in `GraphSpec.retained_observables` with stable IDs, labels, selector refs, and retention policy.\n- Supported selector kinds are visible and validated in the UI path.\n- Legacy probe UI no longer silently creates an objective/loss when the requested object is a retained observable.\n- Targeted frontend tests and build pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Codex (GPT-5) \u003ccodex@openai.com\u003e","files":null}]}